A recorded `promoted-via` names the destination whose {{if .ServesPrompts}}host{{else}}slug or host{{end}} equals it. `none` (legacy marker) or no match (a name another host recorded): ask the user which destination owns the target; never infer a broker from a `mark://` authority{{if not .ServesPrompts}}; a plain destination takes a `mark://<server>/<path>` target as the bare `/path`{{end}}.